ass=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"footer-left\">For Paperwork Reduction Act Notice, see the separate instructions.</div>\n  <div class=\"footer-center\">www.irs.gov/Form945X</div>\n  <div class=\"footer-right\">Cat. No. 20336X</div>\n  <div class=\"footer-right\">Form <span class=\"form-num\">945-X</span> (Rev. 2-2025)</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
